id: multi-form-technique
name: Multi-Form Technique
uaType: magical
prerequisite: N/A
tpCost: 10
type: standard
actionCost: 2
kiCostPerBaseTier: 8
# "Create a Duplicate Minion" - made by the table, as every other sheet is (the user's ruling); counted on the Item.
# "While you have a Duplicate Minion created through the Multi-Form Technique, reduce the Tier of Power of you ... by 1 (if
# already Tier of Power 1, reduce your/their Combat Rolls by 2 instead)" - yours while the count is above none
# (actor-character.mjs, chat.mjs thresholdPenalty); theirs, the table's. "If you fail a Steadfast Check ... those Minions
# are Defeated" - the count to none, said. "As an Instant Maneuver during your turn, you can erase all of your Duplicate
# Minions" - its row's Applied. "You can only possess 1 Duplicate Minion" - 3 with Mass Multi-Form.
multiForm: true
multiFormMost: 1
instantRelease: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Duplicate Minion (the table's to make); while you have one, your Tier of Power 1 lower - or Combat Rolls 2 lower at
  Tier 1. Defeated if you fail a Steadfast Check; erased as an Instant on your turn.
text: >
  Multi-Form Technique: You possess the ability to split yourself into multiple separate entities for a time, allowing
  you to single-handedly outnumber an opponent.
  –Ability Type: Magical
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –TP Cost: 10
  –KP Cost: 8(bT)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 2 Actions
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Create a Duplicate Minion. While you have a Duplicate Minion created through the Multi-Form Technique, reduce
  the Tier of Power of you and any Duplicate Minions created through the Multi-Form Technique by 1 (if already Tier of
  Power 1, reduce your/their Combat Rolls by 2 instead).

  If you fail a Steadfast Check while you have Duplicate Minion(s) created by the Multi-Form Technique, those Minions are
  Defeated.

  As an Instant Maneuver during your turn, you can erase all of your Duplicate Minions created by this Unique Ability.

  You can only possess 1 Duplicate Minion through the effects of Multi-Form Technique.
